{
  "title": "Give shared web modals dialog semantics and keyboard focus management",
  "description": "The recipe design audit found that the shared Modal component renders plain divs without role=dialog, aria-modal, a heading association, initial focus, focus containment, or focus restoration. \
Opening Add to Shopping List leaves focus on the action behind the overlay. \
Add dialog semantics and manage keyboard focus across the shared modal lifecycle, with browser tests for opening, tabbing, Escape, and return focus. iOS uses native sheet presentation; assess its corresponding accessibility when implementing the fix.",
